  "title": "Chocolate-Pecan Muffins with Chocolate Sauce",
  "description": "These chocolate-pecan muffins made with a decadent chocolate sauce and topped with candied pecans are the perfect treat to warm you up on a fall day.",
  "authors": [
    "cy999"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:43:11-04:00",
